# L4: cube shadow maps. A floor at midnight (fog off) with a ring of pillars,
# a cube and a sphere around a warm shadow-casting light, a second
# shadow-casting light (cold, to the right) and an unshadowed green light (left).
# Shadows fan out radially from each casting light; the green light's pool
# passes through the objects near it.
size 640 360
camera 0 20 22  0 0 1  55 0.3 200
lighting sun 0.0 35  4 2048 150 0.6 0
clear 0.02 0.02 0.04 1
item cube 0 -0.5 0  44 1 44  0.8 0.8 0.8
light point 0 2 0  16  1.0 0.75 0.45  5 shadow
light point 9 3 4  12  0.45 0.6 1.0  4 shadow
light point -10 1.5 5  9  0.3 1.0 0.35  4
item cylinder 3 1.5 0  0.6 1.5 0.6  0.85 0.85 0.85
item cylinder -3 1.5 0  0.6 1.5 0.6  0.85 0.85 0.85
item cylinder 0 1.5 3  0.6 1.5 0.6  0.85 0.85 0.85
item cylinder 0 1.5 -3  0.6 1.5 0.6  0.85 0.85 0.85
item cylinder 2.1 1.5 2.1  0.6 1.5 0.6  0.85 0.85 0.85
item cylinder -2.1 1.5 -2.1  0.6 1.5 0.6  0.85 0.85 0.85
item cube 6 1 -2  2 2 2  0.85 0.85 0.85
item sphere -5 1 4  2 2 2  0.85 0.85 0.85
item cube -9 1 6  1.5 2 1.5  0.85 0.85 0.85
